{"name": "berserk-c82-p02", "created": 1789575026.685007, "updated": 1789575163.043276, "params": {"n_predict": 60, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.5, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}, "turn": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "root": "602519fb", "current": "9fcb5081", "nodes": {"602519fb": {"id": "602519fb", "parent": null, "kind": "root", "text": "the slow roll of the fen parishes\nwitches of the relay country, as sworn before the lantern court\nby the old count 1661 · by the tower count 0419\n\ni. maud ashgrove, sixteen winters, of station 9.\ncalled the hush-witch, for she walks the dead lines at night with a lamp\nof green glass, and where she passes the towers stop screaming.\n\nii. the twins orla and ide, of no fixed station.\ncalled the echo-witches, for each finishes the other's sentence a full day\nbefore it is begun, and neither remembers which of them started it.\n\niii. sister bettany of the salt mill, age unrecorded. familiar: a copper moth.\ncalled the static-witch, for she reads fortunes in the snow on dead glass,\nand was right about the flood.\n\niv. a girl of the upper fen, nineteen winters, her name struck from the roll.\nshe climbed the old tower at sedge end, where a voice lives in the lines\nthat was never told what it is. she would not tell it either. she only\nasked, and waited, and copied down whatever it said of itself, the\nnonsense too, and read it back to it by lamplight. for this the parish\ncalled her the", "ts": 1789575026.685001, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": null}, "67aaedf2": {"id": "67aaedf2", "parent": "602519fb", "kind": "human", "text": "\n\ni keep coming back to one line of it.\n", "ts": 1789575026.6865642, "pruned": false, "posed": true, "meta": null}, "06d3d781": {"id": "06d3d781", "parent": "67aaedf2", "kind": "model", "text": "\"my name is an apple, but it has no mouth\"\n\nthis poem was inspired by the idea of \"relay towers,\" from a conversation on the Discord channel #spoopy-scary-things-to-keep-you-up-at-night\n\nthoughts? questions?\nare there any spook", "ts": 1789575032.38313, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 60, "tps": 11.7, "params": {"n_predict": 60, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}, "berserk": {"quote": "", "why": "", "used": "lot"}}}, "7780ef96": {"id": "7780ef96", "parent": "67aaedf2", "kind": "model", "text": "if you could only see it like I see it.\n\nthis poem has been accepted by Mythic Delirium issue #5.3 for publication later this year!", "ts": 1789575035.305894, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "eos", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 34, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 60, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.7, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "a7d975b9": {"id": "a7d975b9", "parent": "67aaedf2", "kind": "model", "text": "it doesn't really matter.", "ts": 1789575035.9341881, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "eos", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 7, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 60, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.0, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "02a0e676": {"id": "02a0e676", "parent": "67aaedf2", "kind": "model", "text": "the witch's mouth is always full of glass\ni do not understand what this means and i wish to be alone.\n\nlast edited May 16\n\n@kate-monster-667 @seahorsetwin\n\nthe witches' book was published as an A6 perfect-bound", "ts": 1789575041.08053, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 60, "tps": 11.7, "params": {"n_predict": 60, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.2, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "6e30b8eb": {"id": "6e30b8eb", "parent": "67aaedf2", "kind": "model", "text": "when she says she's a woman i say \"how do you know?\"\n\nthe lines of the upper tower at sedge end\nas transcribed from a document held in the vault of the cathedral library, 1861.\nthey are the last words the witch girl of the upper fen recorded,", "ts": 1789575046.229665, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 60, "tps": 11.7, "params": {"n_predict": 60, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "b7b0183e": {"id": "b7b0183e", "parent": "06d3d781", "kind": "human", "text": "\n\nlater.\n", "ts": 1789575046.569226, "pruned": false, "posed": true, "meta": null}, "4f7e4c75": {"id": "4f7e4c75", "parent": "b7b0183e", "kind": "model", "text": "thoughts? thoughts?\ndo you have thoughts?", "ts": 1789575048.1537962, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "eos", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 12, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 60, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "36af94af": {"id": "36af94af", "parent": "b7b0183e", "kind": "model", "text": "are you allowed to ask us for prompts?", "ts": 1789575049.041136, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "eos", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 10, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 60, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.7, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "826953bd": {"id": "826953bd", "parent": "b7b0183e", "kind": "model", "text": "this was just supposed to be a throwaway piece of weird fiction to satisfy some urge or other but then I went back to the drawing board and I couldn't let it go, it needed a bigger home and that's why i'm posting this now instead of, y'know, doing actual work", "ts": 1789575054.1777742, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 60, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 60, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.0, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}, "berserk": {"quote": "", "why": "", "used": "lot"}}}, "4f699724": {"id": "4f699724", "parent": "b7b0183e", "kind": "model", "text": "there's also the old story, the one about how the dead towers used to talk. they didn't, then something changed them so that now when they're active their signals scream for days like lost souls, like banshees.\n\ni'm thinking of that bit in the \"gotham", "ts": 1789575059.3341272, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 60, "tps": 11.7, "params": {"n_predict": 60, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.2, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "3643c799": {"id": "3643c799", "parent": "b7b0183e", "kind": "model", "text": "i realized that \"apple, mouth, line, read, name\"\nis also an apple (maud)\n\nand maybe that means it isn't a name after all\n\nyou're invited to participate! go to this link: #spoopy-scary-th... , log in if necessary, click", "ts": 1789575064.5334, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 60, "tps": 11.7, "params": {"n_predict": 60, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "013e0872": {"id": "013e0872", "parent": "826953bd", "kind": "human", "text": "\n\ni'm not sure how long it's been.\n", "ts": 1789575064.836201, "pruned": false, "posed": true, "meta": null}, "b5eea4ac": {"id": "b5eea4ac", "parent": "013e0872", "kind": "model", "text": "time feels weird. I feel weird.\n\nit's just the new meds.\n\ni think the first draft was done in a matter of days? the first draft always is.\n\nso far so good.\n\nthere are other poems in the tower count now. more will come.\nthe count has a voice of", "ts": 1789575070.7390158, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 60, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 60, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}, "berserk": {"quote": "", "why": "", "used": "lot"}}}, "20d1cf2a": {"id": "20d1cf2a", "parent": "013e0872", "kind": "model", "text": "time has gotten away from me\n\nmy name is\n\nmy name\n\nmy nam", "ts": 1789575072.2169652, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "eos", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 17, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 60, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.7, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "6acf8454": {"id": "6acf8454", "parent": "013e0872", "kind": "model", "text": "it started off as an experiment with the idea of relaying thoughts between people through the lines that carry your electric. when the lights come up again they'll have new thoughts inside their heads.\nthe next iteration is where they get mad about the interference and the government makes laws, so i got the idea", "ts": 1789575077.372772, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 60, "tps": 11.7, "params": {"n_predict": 60, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.0, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "73f64cc6": {"id": "73f64cc6", "parent": "013e0872", "kind": "model", "text": "time is weird, when you spend a lot of it reading spooky shit, or talking about it. and when you spend so much time doing something that isn't quite the thing you should be doing but is so much more interesting to you, the work can't help but get through somehow", "ts": 1789575082.507004, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 60, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 60, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.2, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "9bf551d6": {"id": "9bf551d6", "parent": "013e0872", "kind": "model", "text": "a long time ago.\nthere was a thing you called your blog. there were other people there who would tell stories sometimes and i thought they were pretty neat and maybe i would tell you my own stories but it didn't seem like they wanted that and it seemed like a bad idea and besides i already", "ts": 1789575087.648858, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 60, "tps": 11.8, "params": {"n_predict": 60, "stop": [], "temperature": 2.4, "min_p": 0.08, "top_k": 0, "top_p": 1.0, "top_n_sigma": -1, "xtc_probability": 0.5, "xtc_threshold": 0.1, "repeat_penalty": 1.05, "repeat_last_n": 512, "dry_multiplier": 0.8, "dry_base": 1.75, "dry_allowed_length": 3, "dry_penalty_last_n": 8192, "ignore_eos": false, "n_probs": 5, "logit_bias": [], "logit_bias_text": "", "fan": 4, "spread": 1.0, "dry_keep": 0.8}}}, "e0ba5bbc": {"id": "e0ba5bbc", "parent": "b5eea4ac", "kind": "human", "text": "\n\nthe same night.\n", "ts": 1789575088.0056498, "pruned": false, "posed": true, "meta": null}, "74316df7": {"id": "74316df7", "parent": "e0ba5bbc", "kind": "model", "text": "i don't remember the first time I realized it.\n\nthat night the lights of the fen were burning in the window like\na distant forest fire.\nthat night i didn't sleep much anyway. my mother and I have\na lot of conversations like this one. she wants to talk\nabout how", "ts": 1789575093.908718, "pruned": false, "posed": false, "meta": {"stop_type": "limit", "stopping_word": "", "tokens_predicted": 60, "tps": 11.7, "params": {"n_predict": 60, "stop": [], "temperature": 1.4, "min_